  "Name": "SlimFTPd LIST Concatenation Overflow",
  "Description": "This module exploits a stack buffer overflow in the SlimFTPd server. The flaw is triggered when a LIST command is received with an overly-long argument. This vulnerability affects all versions of SlimFTPd prior to 3.16 and was discovered by Raphael Rigo.",
